[ti:(untitled)]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Bas ek pyala hoon... Par bahut matwala hoon,
[00:16.46]Bhari jindagi hai mujh mein... Main adbhut, matwala hoon.
[00:24.91]Kabhi shyaam rang sa gwala ban...
[00:33.37]Main sabko khud mein samaye ek pyala hoon.
[00:41.83]Log dekhte hain mujhko ek maati ka bartan,
[00:50.28]Par mujhmein chhalakta hai anant ka darshan.
[00:58.74]Kahin prem ki amrit dhara, kahin vish ka main jwala hoon,
[01:07.20]Main shunya se janma, har rang mein dhalne wala hoon.
[01:15.66]Mere kan-kan mein basi hai us murli ki taan,
[01:24.11]Main thirakta hoon jaise ho gopiyon ka gaan.
[01:32.57]Na koi bandhan mujhko bhaye, na main kisi ka paala hoon,
[01:41.03]Main swayam mein poorn, swayam ka hi ujaala hoon.
[01:49.48]Main pyala, tu pyala...
[01:57.94]Bhari andar dono mein jwaala!
[02:06.40]Ek hi agni, do alag bhed,
[02:14.85]Mita do ab ye man ka khed.
[02:23.31]Na tu mujhse alag, na main tujhse juda,
[02:31.77]Is jwaala mein hi chhipa hai khuda.
[02:40.22]Khaali dikhta hoon par bharapoor hoon main,
[02:48.68]Har dard se, har ranj se door hoon main.
[02:57.14]Main hi madira, main hi saaqi, main hi peene wala hoon,
[03:05.60]Main hi niyati, main hi maati, main hi rakhwala hoon.
[03:14.05]Bhari jindagi hai mujh mein...
[03:22.51]Main sabko khud mein samaye ek pyala hoon.
[03:30.97]Main adbhut, matwala hoon...
